            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The #646 issue has the same question. Here is [the answer](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/issues/646#issuecomment-1880700124).\r\n\r\nBasically, follow the the [example in the help page to modify target window via split](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a683bfe8e03293e3bb079e24c94e51977756a3ec/doc/mini-files.txt#L429-L458) and follow it up by opening file as usual (it will be opened in the newly created split).\r\n\r\nClosing as duplicate.",
